      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUSH MAYHEM (2) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (22.25) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Worth another chance. SHEIKH OF TWEAK (8) jumped well from the low draw and led all the way to score last start (22.41) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 390m. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. PAW YAZ (1) struggled to get involved last start after losing her position early at Shepparton, but prior to that won by 1.75 lengths at Geelong (22.61) beating Tricky Disco in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 on September 1. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Key player if finds best. WHERE'S PADDY (3) is always hard to beat when he races here at this trip.",
